#: ktipwindow.cpp:52
msgid "Useful Tips"
msgstr "Faydalı Kiñäşlär"

#: tips.cpp:3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"There's a lot of information about KDE on the\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">KDE web site</A>. There are\n"
"also useful sites for major applications like\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>,\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A>, or important\n"
"KDE utilities like\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrint</A>,\n"
"which can be put to its full usage even outside KDE...\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE turında belem\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kde.org/\">KDE säxifäsendä</A> bik küp. Anıñ\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.konqueror.org/\">Konqueror</A>,\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.koffice.org/\">KOffice</A> and\n"
"<A HREF=\"http://www.kdevelop.org/\">KDevelop</A> kebek töp yazılımnarnıñ "
"ayırıp säxifäläre dä bar. Şulay uq \n"
"<A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrint</A> kebek töp qorallarnıñ\n"
"üz säxifälärendä dä küp närsä tabıp bula...\n"
"</P>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:22
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is translated into many languages. You can change the country and\n"
"language with the Control Center or in\n"
"K-Menu->Preferences->Personalization->Country & Language.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Andrea Rizzi</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE bugöngä küp tellärgä tärcemälände inde. İdärä Bülmäse eçendä bulğan\n"
"\"Cirläşterü &amp; İreşülek\" bülegendäge \"İl/Töbäk belän Tel\" bitendä\n"
"yäşäw cire belän uzeñä qulayraq bulğan eş telen saylap bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>KDE tärcemäläre belän anıñ tärcemäçeläre turında kübrägen <a\n"
"href=\"http://i18n.kde.org/\">http://i18n.kde.org</a> "
"säxifäsendä beleşergä bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/locale.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Andrea Rizzi tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:35
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can minimize all your windows on the current desktop at once and\n"
"thus reach the desktop itself by clicking on the desktop icon on the\n"
"panel.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Östälneñ üzenä tizräk elägü öçen, taqta östendä bulğan räsemgä basıp,\n"
"biredäge östäldä açıq bulğan täräzälärne beryulı törep tä quyarğa bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Ägär xäzer ul räsem anda yuq ikän, ul taqta östendä uñ töymäle çirtü aşa, \n"
"«Taqta->Ayırım Töymä» bitendäge «Östälgä İreşü» köyläwen açıp bula.\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/desktop.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:46
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you temporarily need more screen real-estate, you can <strong>\"fold\n"
"in\" the panel</strong> by clicking on one of the arrows at the ends of\n"
"the panel. Alternatively, make it hide automatically by changing the\n"
"settings in the Control Center (Desktop->Panels, Hiding tab).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Waqıtlıça kübräk urın kiräk bulğan çaqta, taqta azaqlarında bulğan berär uqqa "
"tortep,\n"
"ul <strong>taqtanı \"törep quy\"</strong>arğa da bula.\n"
"Monı urınına, İdärä Bülmäse eçendä Östäl->Taqta bülegendä Yäşerü yaqrağında\n"
"bulğan köylämä açıp, ul taqtanıñ üzennän üze yäşerelüen açarğa bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>KDE'nıñ Kicker Taqtası turında kübrägen <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kicker\">Kicker Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:56
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The program Klipper, which is started by default and resides in the\n"
"system tray at the right end of the panel, keeps a number of text\n"
"selections around. These can be retrieved or even (in the case of\n"
"URLs, for example) be executed.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Üzennän üze cibärelep, taqtanıñ asqı uñ poçmağında bulğan sistem tiräse eçendä "
"utıruçı\n"
"Klipper yazılımı, soñğı arada saylanğan bulğan yazmalarnı üz eçendä saqlap "
"bara.\n"
"Ul saqlanğan närsälärne kire alıp ta bula.\n"
"Ägär ul närsä URL kebek ikän, anı cibärep qararğa da bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Klipper turında kübrägen <a href=\"help:/klipper\">Klipper Qullanması</a> "
"eçendä uqıp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/klipper.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The window list, which is accessible via an icon on the panel, provides a\n"
"quick overview of all windows on all virtual desktops.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Taqta östendäge räsemgä basu arqılı açıluçan täräzä-tezmäsendä, bar öställärdä "
"bulğan täräzälär turında açıqlama kürep bula. Monnan tış,\n"
"şul täräzä-tezmäsen Alt+F5 basu arqılı da açıp bula.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/window_list.png\">\n"
"</center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:78
msgid ""
"<p>The <b>\"Location\" label</b> in Konqueror is draggable.</p>\n"
"<p>This means you can create shortcuts (e.g. on the desktop or the panel)\n"
"by dragging it there with the mouse. You can also drop it on to Konsole or\n"
"edit fields to get the URL typed in there (as you can with links or files\n"
"displayed in Konqueror).</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Konqueror'nın <b>\"Urınlaşu\" yazmasın</b> österep bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Yäğni östäl yä ki taqta kebek urınnarda çaptırma yasaw öçen,\n"
"anı küse belän österep taşlarğa bula. Şul urınlaşu yazmasın başqa yazılım\n"
"täräzäsenä yä ki kertü qırına österep, URLın alıp bula. Şulay itep, ul\n"
"Konqueror täräzäsendäge birem/bäylär kebek eşli.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:87
msgid ""
"<p>For quick access to KDEPrint Manager type\n"
"<strong>\"print:/manager\"</strong>... --  <em>\"Type where?\"</em>,\n"
" you may ask. Type it...</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li>...either in Konqueror's <i>address field</i>,</li>\n"
"  "
"<li>...or in a <i>Run Command</i> dialog,\n"
"         opened by pressing <strong>Alt+F2</strong>.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDEPrint İdäräçen tiz açu öçen,\n"
"<strong>\"print:/manager\"</strong> kertäse... --  <em>\"Qayda kertäse?\"</em>"
",\n"
" dip sorasañ, bolarda kertäse:</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li>...Konqueror'nıñ <i>urınlaşu yulında</i>,</li>\n"
"  "
"<li>...yä <i>Boyırıq Cibärü</i> täräzäsendä,\n"
"         anısı <strong>Alt+F2</strong> arqılı ireşüle.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:103
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Double-clicking on the titlebar of any window \"shades\" it, which means\n"
"that only the titlebar stays visible. Double-clicking the titlebar a\n"
"second time will make the window visible again."
"<br>\n"
"Of course, you can change this behavior within the Control Center.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Täräzä başlığına ike-tapqırlı çirtep, ul täräzäne \"törep\" bula, yäğni\n"
"anıñ başlığı ğına kürengän qalır. Berär sekunddan soñ şul uq\n"
"ike-tapqırlı çirtü arqılı ul täräzäne kire torğızıp bula."
"<br>\n"
"Älbättä, İdärä Üzäge eçendä bu çağılışnı üzgärtep bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>KDE'da täräzälär belän eşläw yulları turında kübrägen\n"
"<a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\">"
"KDE Qullanması</a>\n"
"eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:113
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can cycle through the windows on a virtual desktop by holding the\n"
"Alt key and pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Östäldäge täräzälär arasında küçü öçen, Alt+Tab yä ki Shift+Tab basası.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kcmkwm.png\"></center></p>\n"
"<p>Kübrägen\n"
"<a href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html\">"
"KDE Qullanması</a>\n"
"eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:121
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can assign <b>keyboard shortcuts</b> to your favorite applications in the\n"
"KDE menu editor (K-menu->Settings->Menu Editor). Select the application\n"
"(e.g. Konsole), then the tab \"Advanced\" and enter e.g. \"Ctrl+Alt+K\"\n"
"(or use the \"Change\" button).</p>\n"
"<p>That's it! Now fire up Konsoles with Ctrl+Alt+K!</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE saylaq tözätkeçenä kerep (K-saylaq->Caylaw->Saylaq Tözätkeç), \n"
"iñ qullanılğan yazılımnarğa <b>töymäle taqma</b> bilgelärgä bula.\n"
"Berär yazılım saylap (ü.ö. Konsol), \"Östämäle\" yafrağına kerep,\n"
"\"Xäzerge taqma\" yanındağı räsemgä törtep, töymälärdän berär \n"
"tezmä saylarğa (äytik, Ctrl+Alt+K).\n"
"<p>Bette kitte! Bonnan birle, Ctrl+Alt+K töymälärenä basıp Konsol\n"
"yazılımın tiz cibärep bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:131
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can configure the number of virtual desktops by adjusting the \"Number\n"
"of desktops\" slider in the Control Center (Desktop->Multiple Desktops).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Öställär sanın üzgärtü öçen, İdärä Üzäge eçendä \"Östäl->Östäl Sanı\"\n"
"bülegendä bulğan üzgärtü çaraların qullanırğa bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Öställär turında kübrägen <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html#using-multiple-deskt"
"ops\">\n"
"KDE Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:139
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>The KDE project was founded in October 1996 and had its first release,\n"
"1.0, on July 12, 1998.</p>\n"
"<p>You can <em>support the KDE project</em> with work (programming, designing,\n"
"documenting, proof-reading, translating, etc.) and financial or\n"
"hardware donations. Please contact <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"if you are interested.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE sölgese 1996. yılnıñ Öktäber ayında başlanıp, anıñ 1.0 sanlı söreme\n"
"1998. yılnıñ 12. Yülendä dönya kürde.</p>\n"
"<p>Sin dä <em>KDE sölgesenä bulışa</em> bulışa alasıñ; anı yazu, tözü,\n"
"qullanma äzerläw, tärcemäläw kebek eşlärdä qatnaşıp, igänäçese bulıp yä\n"
"timer-tomırlar tapşırıp. Bulışırğa teläk bulsa, <a\n"
" href=\"mailto:kde-ev@kde.org\">kde-ev@kde.org</a>\n"
"adresına yazası, yä başqaça bulışırğa teläk bulsa inde <a\n"
"href=\"mailto:kde-quality@kde.org\">kde-quality@kde.org</a> "
"adresı yulıñ bulır.</p>\n"

