#: tips.cpp:163
msgid ""
"<p>You can stay up to date with new developments in KDE and releases\n"
"by regularly checking the web site <A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A>.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><A\n"
" HREF=\"http://www.kde.org\">http://www.kde.org</A> säxifäsenä waqıt-waqıt\n"
"kerep torıp, KDE'nıñ yaña söremnäre çığu turında belep bula.</p>\n"
"<BR>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:172
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (I)</strong></p>\n"
"<p><strong>kprinter</strong>, KDE's new printing utility supports\n"
"different print subsystems. These subsystems differ very much\n"
"in their abilities.</p>\n"
"<p>Among the supported systems are:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>CUPS, the new Common UNIX Printing System;</li>\n"
"<li>LPR/LPD, traditional BSD-style printing;</li>\n"
"<li>RLPR (no need for \"printcap\" editing or root privileges to\n"
"use network printers);</li>\n"
"<li>printing through an external program (generic).</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE astında Bastıru (1)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>KDE'nıñ <strong>kprinter</strong> qoralı törle bastıru sistemnären tota.\n"
"Ul sistemnär üz bastıru mömkinlekläre belän şaqtí ayırıla.</p>\n"
"<p>Totılğan sistemnär arasında boları bar:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>CUPS, UNIX astında töp bastıru sisteme;</li>\n"
"<li>LPR/LPD, BSD öçen kebek bastıru;</li>\n"
"<li>RLPR, anı qullanğanda \"printcap\" üzgärtäse yuq, çeltärle basaqlar "
"qullanğanda root xoquqlarına iä bulası yuq;</li>\n"
"<li>tışqı qorallar arqılı bastıru.</li>\n"
"</ul>\n"

#: tips.cpp:188
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDEPrinting (II)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>Not all print subsystems provide equal abilities\n"
"for KDEPrint to build on.</p>\n"
"<p>The <A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrinting Team</A>\n"
"recommends installing a <A\n"
"HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS-based</strong></A>\n"
"software as the underlying print subsystem.</p>\n"
"<p> CUPS provides easy usage, powerful features, broad printer\n"
"support and a modern design (based on IPP, the \"Internet\n"
"Printing Protocol\"). Its usefulness is proven for home users\n"
"as well as for large networks.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE astında Bastıru (2)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>Bar bastıru sistemnäre dä üz eşli aluları belän KDEPrint öçen bertigez "
"tügel.</p>\n"
"<p><A HREF=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">KDEPrinting Törkeme</A>\n"
"dä bastıru sisteme itep <A\n"
"HREF=\"http://www.cups.org/\"><strong>CUPS-asılında</strong></A>\n"
"bulğan yazılımnarnı qullanırğa kiñäş itä.</p>\n"
"<p> CUPS küpsanlı köçle mömkinleklär birä, küp basaqlar tota,\n"
"yañaça tözelgän (IPP asılında, \"Internet\n"
"Printing Protocol\"). Anı qullanırğa öydä dä, çeltärdä dä uñaylı.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:205
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE is based on a well-designed C++ foundation. C++ is a programming\n"
"language well suited to desktop development. The KDE object model\n"
"extends the power of C++ even further. See\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
"for details.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE eçtälege yaqşı-tözelgän C++ asılında tora. Eş yözarasın yazu öçen\n"
"C++ tele bik tä kileşä. KDE cisemnär tözeleşe\n"
"C++ qüäten tağın da arttıra. Kübrägen\n"
" <a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org/</a>\n"
"säxifäsendä uqísı.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:216
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can use Konqueror to <strong>browse through tar archives</strong>,\n"
"even compressed ones. You can extract files simply by dragging them\n"
"to another place, e.g. another Konqueror window or the desktop.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Konqueror ul <strong>tar tuplama eçendä gizgändä</strong> dä yaraqlı,\n"
"alar qızılğan bulsalar da. Biremnärne österep, alarnı başqa urınğa küçerep "
"bula,\n"
"ü.ö. Konqueror'nıñ başqa täräzäsenä yä ki östälgä.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:224
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can cycle through the virtual desktops by holding the Ctrl key and\n"
"pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cpp:231
msgid ""
"<p>You can start <strong>kprinter</strong> as a standalone program\n"
"from any xterm, Konsole window or from the \"Run Command\" dialog (started\n"
"by pressing <i>Alt+F2</i>). Then select the file to print. You can print\n"
"as many items of different types as you want, all at once.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\"></center>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>kprinter</strong> qoralın berär xterm, Konsol täräzäse yä ki "
"\"Boyırıq Eşlätü\" (Alt+F2 aşa) täräzäsennän ayırım yazılımday da cibärep bula. "
"Şunnan soñ bastıru öçen berär birem saylísı qala. Bastırası närsälärne yä "
"berämtekläp, yä bergäläp saylap bula.</p>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\"></center>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:243
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You may at any time switch <strong>kprinter</strong> to another\n"
"print subsystem \"on the fly\" (and you don't need to be root to do it.)\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Laptop users who frequently change to different environments may find\n"
"<A HREF=\"ftp://truffula.com/pub/\">RLPR</A> a useful complement to CUPS\n"
"(or any other print subsystem they use as their preferred one).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><strong>kprinter</strong> qoralın \"oçqan çaqta\" da başqa bastıru sisteme "
"belän eşläwgä küçerep bula, monı öçen root xoquqlarına iä bulası yuq.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>Törle çeltärgä yış totaşılıp yörüçe qulsanaq qullanuçıları CUPS östämä itep "
"<A HREF=\"ftp://truffula.com/pub/\">RLPR</A> qoralın da uñay küräçäkter(yä "
"başqa caylı kürengän bastıru sistemen).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:255
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE's help system can display not only KDE's own HTML-based help, but\n"
"also info and man pages.</P>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>\n"
"KDE'nıñ yärdäm sisteme üz HTML-asılında yärdämen genä tügel,\n"
"info/man bitlären dä kürsätä ala.</P>\n"
"<p>Yärdäm alu yulları turında kübrägen <a\n"
"href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/getting-help.html\">KDE Qullanması</a> "
"eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:263
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<P>Clicking with the right mouse button on panel icons or applets opens a\n"
"popup menu that allows you to move or remove the item, or add a new one.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Taqtada ikon yä applet östenä uñ töymä belän çirtü aşa, alarnı "
"üçerü/beterü/östäw\n"
"mömkinlegen birüçe saylaq yözep çığa.</P>\n"
"<p>KDE'nıñ Kicker Taqtası turında kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kicker\">"
"Kicker Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:269
msgid ""
"<P>If a toolbar is not large enough to display all buttons on it, you can\n"
"click on the small arrow at the far right end of the toolbar to see\n"
"the remaining buttons.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>Qoraltirä ülçäme bar töymälärne dä kürsätü öçen citmi ikän, ul qoraltirä "
"azağında bulğan uq östenä çirtep, qalğan töymälärne kürep bula.</P>\n"

#: tips.cpp:276
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Need comprehensive info about KDEPrinting?"
"<br> </p>\n"
"<p> Type <strong>help:/kdeprint/</strong> into a Konqueror address field\n"
"and get the\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/handbook/\">"
"KDEPrint Handbook</a>\n"
"displayed.</p> "
"<p>This, plus more material (like a\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/\">FAQ</a>, various\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/\">Tutorials</a>,\n"
"a \"TipsNTricks\" section and the\n"
" <a href=\"http://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-print/\">"
"kdeprint mailing list</a>)\n"
" are available at\n"
"<a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">printing.kde.org</a>...\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE eçendä bastıru turında küräk beläse kiläme?"
"<br> </p>\n"
"<p>Konqueror'nıñ adres qırında <strong>help:/kdeprint/</strong> "
"kertep, açılğannı uqı da, <a "
"href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/handbook/\">"
"KDEPrint Qullanmasın</a> öyränep çıq.</p>\n"
"<p>Monnan tış, <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/\">printing.kde.org</a> "
"säxifäsendäge \n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/\">YBS</a> belän törle\n"
" <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/documentation/tutorials/\">Däresleklär</a>"
", Kiñäş büleklären, <a href=\"http://mail.kde.org/mailman/listinfo/kde-print/\">"
"kdeprint kündermäsen</a> dä östäp bula.</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:295
msgid ""
"<P>You can run non-KDE applications without problems on a KDE\n"
"desktop. It is even possible to integrate them into the menu system.\n"
"The KDE program \"KAppfinder\" will look for known programs to integrate\n"
"them into the menu.</P>\n"
msgstr ""
"<P>KDE-bulmağan yazılımnarnı da cibärep bula. Alarnı xättä saylaqqa da kertep "
"bula.KDE'nıñ \"KAppfinder\" qoralı bar belän yazılımnarnı tabıp, alarnı saylaq "
"eçendä salır.</P>\n"

#: tips.cpp:303
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can quickly move the panel to another screen edge by \"grabbing\" it "
"with\n"
"the left mouse button and moving it to where you want it.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE taqtasın küseneñ sul töymäse belän \"österep\", küräkneñ başqa yağına "
"küçerep bula.</p>\n"
"<p>KDE'nıñ Kicker Taqtası turında kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kicker\">"
"Kicker Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:309
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you need to kill some time, KDE comes with an extensive collection\n"
"of games.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Beraz buş waqıt ütkäräse kilä ikän, KDE belän bergä küp uyınnardan torğan "
"cıyıntıq kilä.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/package_games.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:318
msgid ""
"<p>You can <strong>quickly change the background</strong> image of the\n"
"desktop by dragging a graphics image from a Konqueror window to the\n"
"desktop background.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Konqueror täräzäsennän berär sürät biremen östäl östenä taşlap, <strong>"
"östäl cäymäsen ciñel almaştırıp</strong> bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:325
msgid ""
"<p>You can change the background color of the desktop by dragging a color\n"
"from a color selector in any application to the desktop background.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Berär yazılımda bulğan tös-saylaqtağı berär tösen östälgä taşlap, <strong>"
"östäl tösen ciñel almaştırıp</strong> bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:332
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"A fast way to get your favorite application onto your panel is to\n"
"right-click the panel (Panel Menu) and select Add->Button->whatever.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Taqta östenä uñ töymä belän çirtü aşa Taqta Saylağın çığarıp, anda bulğan "
"\"Östäw->Yazılım-›berärne\" atlı keremen saylap, oşağan yazılımnarnı Taqtağa "
"östäp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:340
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can add more applets to your panel by selecting Panel\n"
"Menu->Add->Applet from the K menu.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Taqta Saylağındağı \"Östäw->Applet\" kereme aşa Tatqa eçenä berär applet "
"östäp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:348
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can add a little command line to your panel by selecting Panel\n"
"Menu->Add->Applet->Application Launcher from the K menu.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Taqta Saylağındağı \"Östäw->Applet\" kereme aşa Tatqa eçenä berär applet "
"östäp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:356
msgid ""
"<p>Want to see the local time of your friends or\n"
"business partners <b>around the world</b>?</p>\n"
"<p>Just press the middle mouse button on the <b>panel clock</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Dönyada taralğan</b> iptäşlär belän eş qärdäşläreñeñ cirle waqıtın küräse "
"kiläme?</p>\n"
"<p>Monı öçen, küseneñ uñ töymäse belän <b>säğät cirenä</b> çert.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:363
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>Your <b>panel clock</b> can be configured to display the time\n"
"in <b>plain</b>, <b>digital</b>, <b>analog</b> or <b>fuzzy-style</b>\n"
"mode.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p><b>Säğäteñ</b> waqıtnı <b>ciñel</b>, <b>sanlı</b>, <b>uqlı</b> da <b>"
"tögäl-bulmağan</b> kileş kürsätä ala.</p>\n"
"<p>Kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kicker/clock-applet.html\">Kicker Qullanması</a> "
"eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:370
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you know its name, you can <strong>execute any program</strong> by pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong>\n"
"and entering the program name in the command-line window provided."
"<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kmenu.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Yazılım isemen belgän çaqta, <strong>Alt+F2</strong> "
"basqanda çıqqan boyırıq-yulında anı kertep, <strong>"
"törle yazılımnı eşlätep</strong> bula."
"<p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/kmenu.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:381
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>browse any URL</strong> by pressing\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> and entering the URL in the\n"
"command-line window provided.\n"
"</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/network.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> basqanda çığuçı boyırıq-yulında URL kertü aşa, teläsä "
"nindi <strong>URL eçtälegen qarap</strong> bula.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/filesystems/network.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:392
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>If you are using Konqueror and want to type another location into\n"
"the location field below the toolbar to get there, you can clear the\n"
"whole field very quickly with the black button with a white cross\n"
"to the left of the \"Location\" label and start typing.</p>\n"
"<p>You can also press Ctrl+O to open a dialog to enter another location.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Konqueror qullanılğan çaqta, qoraltirä astında \"Urınlaşu\" atlı yulınnan "
"sulda bulğan aq çatlı qara töymägä çirtü aşa ul yulın tiz buşatıp, yaña "
"urınlaşunı kertep bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Şulay uq Ctrl+L basıp ta urınlaşu yulına tiz küçep bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:401
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can access a <strong>man page</strong> by entering a\n"
"hash mark (#) and the name of the man page wherever you can enter\n"
"a URL, like in the location field of the web browser or the\n"
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> command-line.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Berär nindi <strong>man-bit</strong> açu öçen, URL kertergä yaraqlı bulğan "
"cirdä çat bilgese (#) artınnan man-bit isemen kertergä kiräk. Monı öçen, "
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> aşa açılğan boyırıq eşlätü taräzäseneñ dä, "
"web-gizgeçneñ dä urınlaşu yulları yarar.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:412
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can access an <strong>info page</strong> by entering a double hash mark "
"(##)\n"
" and the\n"
"name of the info page wherever you can enter a URL, like in the URL\n"
"line of the web browser or the <strong>Alt+F2</strong> command-line.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Berär nindi <strong>info-bit</strong> açu öçen, URL kertergä yaraqlı bulğan "
"cirdä ike çat bilgese (##) artınnan info-bit isemen kertergä kiräk. Monı öçen, "
"<strong>Alt+F2</strong> aşa açılğan boyırıq eşlätü taräzäseneñ dä, "
"web-gizgeçneñ dä urınlaşu yulları yarar.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/khelpcenter.png\">\n"

#: tips.cpp:425
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you can't access the titlebar, you can still <strong>move a window</strong>\n"
"on the screen by holding the Alt key, clicking anywhere into the window\n"
"and \"dragging\" it with the mouse.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"Of course, you can change this behavior by using the Control Center.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Täräzä başlığına ireşep bulmağan çaqta, Alt töymäsen basqan kileş, küse "
"belän \"österep\", <strong>täräzäne küçerep</strong> bula.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<p>Bu çağılışnı İdärä Üzägendä üzgärtep tä bula älbättä.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:434
msgid ""
"<p> Want KDE's printing power in non-KDE apps?  </p>\n"
"<p> Then use <strong>'kprinter'</strong> as \"print command\".\n"
"Works with Netscape, Mozilla, Galeon, gv, Acrobat Reader,\n"
" StarOffice, OpenOffice.org, any GNOME application and many more...</p>\n"
"<p>See <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/kdeprint.phtml#out\">"
"printing.kde.org</a>\n"
"for more detailed hints...\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE'nıñ bastıru köçen KDE-bulmağan yazılım eçennän dä qullası kiläme?</p>\n"
"<p>Ul çaqta <strong>'kprinter'</strong> qoralın \"bastıru boyırığı\" kebek "
"qullanası inde.\n"
"Bu närsä Netscape, Mozilla, Galeon, gv, Acrobat Reader, StarOffice, "
"OpenOffice.org, GNOME-yazılımnarda da, küp başqa närsälärdä dä eşli...</p>\n"
"<p>Başqa kiñäşlärne <a href=\"http://printing.kde.org/faq/kdeprint.phtml#out\">"
"printing.kde.org</a>\n"
"säxifäsendä tabıp bula...\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:448
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can <strong>resize a window</strong> on the screen by holding the Alt key,\n"
"right-clicking anywhere into the window and moving the mouse.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Alt töymäsen basqan kileş, küseneñ uñ töymäse belän täräzä östenä çirtep "
"küçü aşa, ul <strong>täräzä ülçämen</strong> üzgärtep bula.</p>"
"<br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:455
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's mail client (KMail) provides seamless <strong>PGP/GnuPG\n"
" integration</strong>\n"
"for encrypting and signing your email messages.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Xatlarnı serläp imzalaw öçen, KDE'nıñ KMail atlı email-yazılımda <strong>"
"PGP/GnuPG belän eşläw</strong> kertelgän.</p>\n"
"<p>Serläwne caylap quyu turında <a href=\"help:/kmail/pgp.html\">"
"KMail Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:463
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can find KDE developers all over the world, e.g., in Germany,\n"
"Sweden, France, Canada, USA, Australia, Namibia, Argentina, even in\n"
"Norway!</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE citeşterüçelären boten dönyada tabıp bula, alar Almania, İswäc, Fransia, "
"Kanada, AQŞ, Australia, Namibia, Argentinada ğına tügel Norwegiada da "
"yäşilär!</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"KDE citeşterüçeläre belän elemtägä çığu öçen, <a "
"href=\"http://worldwide.kde.org\">worldwide.kde.org</a> "
"säxifäsenä kerep çıq.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:471
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE's CD player accesses the Internet CD database freedb to provide you\n"
"with title/track information.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KDE'nıñ KsCD atlı CD-uynatqıç, CD'lär turında belem tuplağan, çeltärdä "
"urınlaşqan biremlek belän totaşılıp, yazma açıqlaması belän tä'min itä.</p>\n"
"<p>KsCD belän eş itü turında <a href=\"help:/kscd\">KsCD Qullanması</a> "
"eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:479
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Some people open many terminal windows just to enter <em>one single</em>\n"
"command.</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Use <strong>Alt+F2</strong> for just firing up programs (Alt+F2 \"kword\") "
"or\n"
"<li>use Konsole sessions (\"New\" in toolbar) if you need text output.\n"
"</ul>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Qayber keşelär, <em>ber genä</em> boyırıq birü öçen, berniçä terminal "
"täräzäsen açalar.</p>\n"
"<ul>\n"
"<li>Yazılım cibärü öçen genä <strong>Alt+F2</strong> qullanıp bula, yä inde\n"
"<li>yazılım çığarğanın uqísı bulsa, qoraltirädäge \"Yaña\" saylap, Konsol "
"sessisen qullanıp bula.</ul>\n"

#: tips.cpp:490
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can change the color of the window titlebars by clicking on the title bar "
"of the\n"
"color example in the <em>Appearance & Themes</em> module within the Control "
"Center.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>İdärä Üzäge eçendä bulğan <em>Küreneş & Tışlaw</em> "
"bülegenä kerep, andağı ürnäk-täräzäneñ başlığına törtep, bar täräzälärneñ "
"başlıq töslären üzgärtep quyarğa bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Anda kürep bulğan bär närsälärneñ dä tösen üzgärtep bula.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:498
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE Command Line Printing (I)</strong></p>\n"
"<p> Want to print from command line, without missing KDE's printing power?</p>\n"
"<p> Type <strong>'kprinter'</strong>. Up pops the\n"
"KDEPrint dialog. Select printer, print options and\n"
"print files (and yes!! you may select <em>different</em>\n"
"files of <em>different</em> types for <em>one</em> print job...). </p>\n"
"<p>This works from Konsole, any x-Terminal, or \"Run Command\"\n"
"(called by pressing <em>Alt+F2</em>)</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><strong>-->&nbsp;</strong></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE'da Boyırıq Yulınnan Bastıru (1)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>KDE'nıñ bar köçen dä qullanıp, boyırıq yulınnan bastırası kiläme?</p>\n"
"<p>Alay isä <strong>'kprinter'</strong> kertep, KDEPrint täräzäsen açası.Şunnan "
"soñ berär basaq saylap, bastıru köyläwlären kertep, bastırası biremne cibäräbez "
"(<em>ber</em> yök eçendä <em>berniçä</em> birem cibärep bula, alarnıñ <em>"
"törläre</em> berük bulmasa da).</p>\n"
"<p>Bu ısul Konsol'da, x-Terminal'da, Alt+F2 aşa açıliçı \"Boyırıq Eşlätü\"  "
"täräzäsendä dä eşli.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><strong>-->&nbsp;</strong></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:511
msgid ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE Command Line Printing (II)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"You may specify print files and/or name a printer from the command line:\n"
"<pre>\n"
"kprinter -d infotec \\\n   /home/kurt/paragliding.jpg \\\n   "
"../kdeprint-handbook.pdf \\\n   /opt/kde3/flyer.ps\n"
"</pre>\n"
" This prints 3 different files (from different folders) to printer "
"\"infotec\".\n"
" </p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p align=\"center\"><strong>KDE'da Boyırıq Yulınnan Bastıru (1)</strong></p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Bastırası biremnäre belän basaq adın boyırıq yulında da kürsätep bula:\n"
"<pre>\n"
"kprinter -d infotec \\\n   /home/kurt/paragliding.jpg \\\n   "
"../kdeprint-handbook.pdf \\\n   /opt/kde3/flyer.ps\n"
"</pre>\n"
"Bo boyırıq, törle törgäklärdä yatqan 3 biremne \"infotec\" basağı arqılı "
"çığara.\n"
" </p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:529
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The difference between window manager styles and old-fashioned themes is\n"
"that the former even reflect window titlebar color settings from the\n"
"Control Center and might implement different features.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Täräzä idäräçeneñ tışlawı belän iske tışlawlar belän ayırma nidäñ disäñ, "
"berençelär täräzälär öçen tös caylawların İdärä Üzägennän alıp, yaña "
"mömkinleklär östi ala.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:537
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"The K in KDE does not stand for anything. It is the character that comes\n"
"before L in the Latin alphabet, which stands for Linux. It was chosen\n"
"because KDE runs on many types of UNIX (and perfectly well on FreeBSD).\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE süzendäge K xärefe berni dä añlatmí. Unix'larnıñ kübesendä dä yaxşı eşlägäç "
"(FreeBSD astında bigräk tä), Linux süzendäge baş xärefennän soñ barğan ikençe "
"xärefen alğannar da, KDE'gä quyğannar inde, şul ğına.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:546
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to know when <b>the next release</b> of KDE is planned,\n"
"look for the release schedule on <a\n"
" href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a>. If you only\n"
"find old release schedules, there will probably be some weeks/months of\n"
"intensive development left before the next release.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ägär dä KDE'neñ <b>kiläse söremen</b> çığaru qayçaqlarğa niätlängänen beläse "
"kilä ikän,\n"
"<a href=\"http://developer.kde.org/\">http://developer.kde.org</a> "
"säxifäsendä kerep qararğa bula.Ul säxifädä, elegräk çıqqan söremnär turında "
"ğına äytelsä, dimäk berniçä atna/aydan soñ çığaru öçen, yaña sörem östendä qatı "
"eş bar.</p>"
"<br>\n"
"<center><img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/apps/konqueror.png\"></center>\n"

#: tips.cpp:556
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Under the <em>\"B II\"</em> window decoration, the title bars\n"
"automatically move by themselves so they are always visible! You can\n"
"edit your title bar decoration by right clicking on your title bar and\n"
"selecting \"Configure...\".</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Täräzä bizäkläw öçen <em>\"B II\"</em> tışlawı saylanğan bulsa,\n"
"täräzä başlıqları bar çaqta da kürengän cirgä küçep torırlar. Başlıq tiräsen "
"bizäkläw ısulın saylaw öçen, aña uñ çirtü aşa \n"
"\"Täräzä Çağılışın Caylaw...\" keremen saylarğa kiräk.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:565
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>If you don't like the default completion mode, e.g. in Konqueror, you\n"
"can right-click on the edit-widget and choose a different mode, e.g.\n"
"automatic or manual completion. Manual completion works similar to\n"
"completion in a UNIX shell. Use Ctrl+E to invoke it.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Süz tutırunıñ töp ısulnıñ eşe oşamasa (Konqueror'da kebek), tözätü-qırında "
"uñ-çirtü aşa başqa ısul da saylap bula, ü.ö. üzennän yä quldan tutıru ısulın. "
"Quldan tutıru ısulınıñ eşe UNIX qabığındağına axşaş, anı çaqıru öçen Ctrl+E "
"qullanıla.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:574
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>If you want another panel, to make more space for your applets and\n"
"buttons, press right mouse button on the panel to invoke the panel menu\n"
"and select \"Add->Panel->Child Panel\".</p>"
"<p>\n"
"(You can then put anything on the fresh panel, adjust its size and\n"
"so on.)</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Başqa apllet astına östämä urın yasaw öçen tağın ber taqta kiräk bulsa, "
"uñ-çirtü aşa taqta saylağın çaqırıp, \"Östäw->Taqta->"
"Eçke Taqta\" keremen saylap bula.</p>\n"
"<p>(Şunnan soñ yaña taqta östenä başqa närsä salıp bula, anıñ ülçämen üzgärtep, "
"başqa eşlär qılırğa.)</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:583
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>If you want to contribute your own \"tip of the day\", please send it to\n"
"<a href=\"mailto:kalle@kde.org\">kalle@kde.org</a>, and we'll be happy to\n"
" integrate\n"
"it for the next release.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Yaña \"kön kiñäse\" östise kilep, anı <a "
"href=\"mailto:kde-doc-english@kde.org\">kde-doc-english@kde.org</a> "
"buyınça cibärsäñ, bez anı yaña söremgä östärgä şat bulırbız.</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:591
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you drag a file from Konqueror or from the desktop to Konsole, you\n"
"will have the choice between pasting the URL or entering that folder.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Choose the one you want, so you do not have to write the entire path\n"
"in the terminal window.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Gerard Delafond</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Ägär Konqueror yä ki östäldän berär biremne österep, Konsol östenä "
"taşlağanda,şul URL östäw belän şul törgäkkä kerü arasında kiräklesen saylap "
"bula.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Telägänen saylap, terminal täräzäsendä şulay itep tulı yul kertüdän qotılıp ta "
"bula.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Gerard Delafond tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:602
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can hide mixer devices in KMix by clicking on \"Hide\" in the\n"
"context menu that appears when you click with the right mouse button\n"
"on one of the sliders.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Stefan Schimanski</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Kmix atlı quşqıçta bulğan ayırım cıhaz şudırmaların, uñ-çirtü aşa çıqqan "
"saylaqtan yäşerep quyarğa bula.</p>\n"
"<p>KMix belän eşläw kiñäşläreneñ kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kmix\">"
"KMix Qullanması</a>  eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Stefan Schimanski tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:612
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can add your own \"Internet Keyword search provider\" by selecting\n"
"Settings->Configure Konqueror->Enhanced Browsing. Click \"Add...\" and\n"
"complete the fields.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Michael Lachmann and Thomas Diehl</em></p>"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Päräwezdä ezläwçe başqa serveren östäw öçen, \"Caylaw-> Konqueror Caylawı-> "
"Başqa Köyläwlär\" bitendä \"Östäw...\" töymäsenä çirtep, kiräklesen kertäse.</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Michael Lachmann &amp; Thomas Diehl tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:622
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Each UNIX user has a so-called Home folder in which his or her\n"
"files as well as user-dependent configuration files are saved. If you\n"
"work in a Konsole window, you can easily change to your home folder\n"
"by entering the <b>cd</b> command without any parameters.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"UNIX qullanuçınıñ barısınıñ da \"Ana törgäk\" dip ataluçı urın bar, anda anıñ "
"şäxsi beremnäre belän caybiremnär yata. Terminal täräzäsendä eşlägän çaqta şul "
"ana-törgäkkä küçü öçen, <b>cd</b> boyırığın bernisez kertergä kiräk.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:633
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You might wonder why there are very few (if any) files whose\n"
"names end in <code>.exe</code> or <code>.bat</code> on UNIX\n"
"systems. This is because filenames on UNIX do not need an\n"
"extension. Executable files in KDE are represented by the gear icon\n"
"in Konqueror. In the Konsole window, they are often colored red\n"
"(depending on your settings).\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"UNIX sistemendä qayber biremnärneñ genä <code>.exe/.bat</code> "
"quşımtaları buluınnan gäcäplängänseñder bälki. Ämma ul UNIX astında alarnıñ "
"kiräk bulmawınnan şulay. Eşçän biremnär Konqueror eçendä teşle tägärmäç räseme "
"belän kürsätelä. Terminal täräzäsendä isä alar yış qızıl itep kürsätelä (bonısı "
"caylawdan bäyle).</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:646
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you want to make your desktop look more interesting, you can find\n"
"tons of themes at <a href=\"http://themes.kde.org/\">themes.kde.org</a>.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Östäl küreneşen qızığraq itü öçen kiräk bulğan tışlawlarnı <a "
"href=\"http://kde-look.org/\">kde-look.org</a> säxifäsendä tabıp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:655
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Did you know that you can use the middle mouse button to paste\n"
"text? Try selecting some text with the left mouse button and click\n"
"elsewhere with the middle mouse button. The selected text will be\n"
"pasted at the click position. This even works between different programs.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Carsten Niehaus</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Saylanğan yazmalarnı küseneñ üzäk töymäsenä çirtü aşa da östäp quyarğa bulu "
"turında belgänieñme äle? Berär cirdä sul töymä belän berär mäten kisägen "
"saylap, ikençe cirdä üzäk töymä belän çertep qara. Şul saylanğan mäten kisäge "
"çirtkän urına kübäyep östälener. Bu närsä törle yazılımnar arasında da eşli.</p>"
"\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Carsten Niehaus tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:666
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Want to print by using \"DragNDrop\"?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Drag a file and drop it on the \"Files\" tab of an opened\n"
"<strong>kprinter</strong> dialog. </p>\n"
"<p>Then continue as you would normally: select a printer, job options, etc.\n"
"and click the \"Print\" button.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Kurt Pfeifle</em></p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Österep taşlaw aşa bastırası kiläme?\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Açıq torğan <strong>kprinter</strong> täräzäseneñ \"Biremnär\" yafrağına "
"biremnärne österep taşlap bula.</p>\n"
"<p>Şunnan soñ inde däwamı ğädättägeçä: basaq saylap, yök köyläwlären tikşerep "
"alası da, \"Bastır\" töymäsenä çirtäse.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<center>\n"
"<img src=\"crystalsvg/48x48/devices/printer1.png\">\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Kurt Pfeifle tarafınnan</em></p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:682
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"If you need to calculate a distance on the screen, the program\n"
"<em>kruler</em> can be of great help.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Furthermore, if you need to look closely at the ruler to count single\n"
"pixels, <em>kmag</em> may be very useful. (It is not part of the KDE base\n"
"installation but needs to be installed separately. It might already be\n"
"available on your distribution.) <em>kmag</em> works\n"
"just like <em>xmag</em>, with the difference that it magnifies on the fly.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jesper Pedersen</em></p>"
"<br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"Küräkta ike tap arasında bulğan aranı sanísı bulsa, <em>kruler</em> "
"atlı yazılım bik yärdäm itä ala.</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Bonnan tış, sızma yanındağı taplarnı sanap çığası bulsa, sürätne erelätä torğan "
"<em>kmag</em> digän närsä bulışa ala. (KDE öleşe bulmağaç, anı ayırım quyarğa "
"kiräk buluı bar). Bu <em>kmag</em> digäne <em>xmag</em> "
"kebek bulsa da, anı «oçqan-çaqta» eşläw mömkinlege bar.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jesper Pedersen tarafınnan</em></p>"
"<br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:697
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Sound in KDE is coordinated by the <b>artsd</b> sound server. You can\n"
"configure the sound server from the Control Center by selecting\n"
"Sound->Sound Server.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>"
"<br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE eçendä tawış çığarunı <b>artsd</b> atlı tawış xezmäte qarí.\n"
"İdärä Üzäge eçendäge Tawış & Multimedia –> Tawış Servere digän bülegendä anı "
"caylaştırıp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jeff Tranter tarafınnan</em></p>"
"<br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:707
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can associate sounds with KDE events. This can be configured\n"
"from the Control Center by selecting Sound->System Notifications.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>"
"<br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE waqíğalarına tawış belän atılma täräzälär kebek närsälärne kileşterep "
"bula.\n"
"Bonı İdärä Üzäge eçendäge Tawış &amp; Multimedia -> Sistem Belderüläre digän "
"bülegendä caylaştırıp bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jeff Tranter tarafınnan</em></p>"
"<br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:716
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"Most non-KDE sound applications that do not know about the sound server can be\n"
"run using the <b>artsdsp</b> command. When the application is run, accesses to\n"
"the audio device will be redirected to the <b>artsd</b> sound server.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"The command format is:"
"<br>\n"
"<b>artsdsp</b> <em>application</em> <em>arguments</em> ...\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Contributed by Jeff Tranter</em></p>"
"<br>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE-bulmağan tawış yazılımnarnıñ kübese tawış servere turında belmäsä dä, <b>"
"artsdsp</b> boyırıqları aşa eşli ala. Andí yazılım eşli başlağanda, tawış "
"cıhazı belän aralaşu <b>artsd</b> digän tawış server aşa itep küçerelgän bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Bu boyırıq qulanu bolayraq:"
"<br>\n"
"<b>artsdsp</b> <em>yazılım</em> <em>köylämälär</em> ...\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\"><em>Jeff Tranter tarafınnan</em></p>"
"<br>\n"

#: tips.cpp:730
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"By holding down the <b>Shift</b> button while moving a container (button\n"
"or applet) on the Panel, the container can then be used to push forward\n"
"other containers.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<b>Shift</b> töymäsen basqan kileş totıp, töymä/applet sınam närsälärne küse "
"belän kıçerep bula.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:739
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"You can let KDE turn the <b>NumLock</b> ON or OFF at startup.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"Open the Control Center, select Peripherals->Keyboard and make your\n"
" choice.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr>"
"<br>"
"<br>\n"
"<i>This is the last tip in the tips database. Clicking \"Next\" will take you "
"back to\n"
" the first tip.</i>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"KDE cibärelgän çaqta <b>NumLock</b> töymäsen AÇIQ yä ki SÜNEK itep quyarğa "
"bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"İdärä Üzegendä bulğan Totaşmalar->Töylek bülegen açıp, kiräklesen saylap bula.\n"
"</p>\n"
"<p>\n"
"<hr>"
"<br>"
"<br>\n"
"<i>Kiñäşlär biremlegendä bulğannarı arasında bu kiñäş berençese. \"Kiläse\" "
"töymägä çirtep, berençe kiñäşkä qaytıp bula.</i>\n"
"</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "You can cycle through the virtual desktops by holding the Ctrl key and\n"
#~ "pressing Tab or Shift+Tab.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>For more information about using virtual desktops, look at <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html#using-multiple-desktops\">the\n"
#~ "KDE User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Ctrl+Tab yä ki Shift+Tab töymälären bergä basıp, xıyalí öställär arasında küçep bula.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Öställär turında kübrägen <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/windows-how-to-work.html#using-multiple-desktops\">KDE Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "You can add a little command line to your panel by selecting Panel\n"
#~ "Menu->Add to Panel->Applet->Run Command from the K menu.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ "<p>For information about other applets available for the KDE Panel,\n"
#~ "take a look at <a href=\"help:/kicker\">the Kicker Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Taqta Saylağındağı \"Östäw->Applet->Boyırıq Eşlätü\" keremen saylap, boyırıq kertü yulın tatqa eçenä östäp bula.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>KDE Taqtası eçenä başqa applet östäw turında kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kicker\">Kicker Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE's 'kioslaves' do not just work in Konqueror: you can use network\n"
#~ "URLs in any KDE application. For example, you can enter a URL like\n"
#~ "ftp://www.server.com/myfile in the Kate Open dialog, and Kate will\n"
#~ "open the file and save changes back to the FTP server when you click\n"
#~ "on 'Save.'\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE'neñ 'kioslaves' Konqueror eçendä genä tügel: çeltärle URL'nı bar KDE-yazılımda da qullanıp bula;\n"
#~ "ü.ö. Kate eçendä Açu täräzäsendä ftp://www.server.com/biremem kebek berär URL kertelsä, Kate anı şul ftp-serverdän iñderep açar da, saqlarğa digän boyırığına şul servergä yökläp tä quyar.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "You can use Konqueror to access your files on any server that you have\n"
#~ "ssh access to. Just enter fish://<em>username</em>@<em>hostname</em> in\n"
#~ "Konqueror's location bar.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "In fact, all KDE applications support fish:// URLs - try entering one\n"
#~ "in the Open dialog of Kate, for instance\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "Konqueror qullanıp, ssh ireşü bulğan server biremnäre belän eşläp bula. Bonı öçen, Konqueror'nıñ urınlaşu tiräsendä fish://<em>qullanuadı</em>@<em>hostadı</em> kertergä kiräk.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KMail, the KDE email client, has built-in support for several popular\n"
#~ "spam filtering apps. To set up automatic spam filtering in KMail,\n"
#~ "configure your favorite spam filter as you like it, then go to\n"
#~ "Tools->Anti-spam wizard in KMail.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "For more information, look at <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">the KMail Handbook\n"
#~ "Anti-Spam Wizard chapter</a>.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE'neñ KMail atlı email kliente spam sözgeçläre belän turı eşli ala. Ul sözgeçlärne cibärü öçen, KMail eçendäge saylaq aşa Qoral->Spam'ğa Qarşılıq ostasın cibäräse.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "Bonı turında kübrägen <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/kmail/the-anti-spam-wizard.html\">KMail Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "You can make a window go below other windows by middle-clicking on its titlebar.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "Berär täräzäne başqalar östendä itü öçen, anıñ baslığına urta-çirtergä kiräk.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE applications offer short \"What's This?\" help texts for many\n"
#~ "features. Just click on the question mark on the window titlebar, and\n"
#~ "then click on the item you need help on. (In some themes, the button\n"
#~ "is a lowercase \"i\" instead of a question mark).\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE yazılımnarınıñ küplärendä \"Ni Bu?\" digän yärdäm töre bar. Anı çaqıru öçen, täräzä başlığındağı soraw bilgesenä basarğa kiräk.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE supports several different window focus modes: take a look in the\n"
#~ "Control Center, under Desktop->Window Behavior. For example, if you\n"
#~ "use the mouse a lot, you might prefer the \"Focus follows mouse\" setting.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "KDE üze täräzälärgä fokusnı törle ısul belän küçerä ala. Bonı İdärä Üzäge eçendäge Östäl -> Täräzä Eşläwe digän bülegendä caylap bula. Ul ısullar arasında, küse ütep kitkän täräzägä fokusnı küçerü da bar.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "Konqueror can continuously scroll webpages up or down: just press\n"
#~ "Shift+Up Arrow or Shift+Down Arrow. Press the key combination again to\n"
#~ "increase the speed, or any other key to stop the scrolling.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>\n"
#~ "Konqueror eçendä web-bitne öskä/asqa taba çornap bula: Shift belän bergä Öskä/Asqa Uq töymälärenä genä basası.\n"
#~ "</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>You can use Konqueror's help:/ kioslave to have quick and easy\n"
#~ "access to an application's handbook by typing <b>help:/</b>, directly\n"
#~ "followed by the application name, in the Location bar. So, for example\n"
#~ "to view the handbook for kwrite simply type help:/kwrite.</p> \n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Berär yazılım yärdämen açu öçen, Konqueror'nıñ Urınlaşu tiräsendä ul yazılım adı aldında <b>help:/</b> genä kertep quyası; ü.ö. kwrite qullanmasın acu öçen, help:/kwrite kertäse.</p> \n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Thanks to the <a href=\"http://svg.kde.org\" title=\"ksvg\">KSVG\n"
#~ "project</a>, KDE now has full support for the Scalable Vector Graphics\n"
#~ "(SVG) image filetypes. You can view these images in Konqueror and even\n"
#~ "set an SVG image as a background for your desktop.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>There is also a great bunch of <a\n"
#~ "href=\"http://kdelook.org/index.php?xcontentmode=7\" title=\"kdelook\n"
#~ "SVG\">SVG wallpapers</a> for your desktop background available at <a\n"
#~ "href=\"http://kdelook.org\" title=\"kdelook\">kde-look.org</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p><a href=\"http://svg.kde.org\" title=\"ksvg\">KSVG\n"
#~ "projekt</a> yärdäme belän KDE eçendä Scalable Vector Graphics\n"
#~ "(SVG) digän süräte törlege totıla.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Konqueror's Web Shortcuts feature lets you submit a query directly\n"
#~ "to a search engine without having to visit the website\n"
#~ "first. For example, entering <b>gg:konqueror</b> in Location bar and\n"
#~ "pressing Enter will search Google for items relating to Konqueror.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>To see what further Web Shortcuts are available, and to make your\n"
#~ "own, from Konqueror just select Settings->Configure Konqueror... which\n"
#~ "will open the Settings dialog box, and then just click on the Web\n"
#~ "Shortcuts icon.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Konqueror'nıñ Web Çaptırmasın qullanıp, ezläw maşınalarına alarnıñ säxifälärenä kermiçä dä ireşep bula; ü.ö. Urınlaşu tiräsendä <b>gg:konqueror</b> kertep, Google aşa Konqueror turında belem ezlärgä bula.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Barlıq Web-Çaptırma törlären Konqueror'nıñ Caylaw->Konqueror... digän bülegendä kürep/caylap bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>KDE is always looking to improve its accessibility, and with the\n"
#~ "launch of KTTS (KDE Text-to-Speech) you now have the power to convert\n"
#~ "strings of text into audible speech. </p>\n"
#~ "<p>KTTS is constantly improving, and currently provides support to\n"
#~ "speak all or any portion of plain text files (as viewed in Kate), HTML\n"
#~ "pages in Konqueror, text in the KDE clipboard, as well as speech of\n"
#~ "KDE notifications (KNotify).</p>\n"
#~ "<p>To start the KTTS system, you can either select KTTS in the KDE\n"
#~ "menu, or hit Alt+F2 to run a command and then type <b>kttsmgr</b>. For\n"
#~ "more information on KTTS, check the <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title=\"KTTSD\n"
#~ "Handbook\">KTTSD Handbook</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>KDE qullanu qulayraq bulsın öçen, anın östengä gel genä eş bara; ü.ö. yazmalarnı söyläp birä torğan KTTS (KDE Text-to-Speech) digän xezmät bar. </p>\n"
#~ "<p>KTTS aşa Konqueror eçendäge bitlärne, KDE alışukesä eçtälegen uqıttırırğa bula.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Bonı turında kübrägen <a href=\"help:/kttsd\" title=\"KTTSD\n"
#~ "Qullanması\">KTTSD Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Though KDE is a very stable desktop environment, programs may\n"
#~ "occasionally freeze or crash, particularly if you are running the\n"
#~ "development version of a program, or a program made by a\n"
#~ "third-party. In this case, you can forcibly kill the program if need\n"
#~ "be.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Pressing <b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> will bring up the skull-and-crossbones\n"
#~ "cursor, and once you click on a window with it the program will be\n"
#~ "automatically killed. Note, however, that this is an untidy way of\n"
#~ "shutting down the program which may result in data being lost, and\n"
#~ "some partner processes may still remain running. This should only be\n"
#~ "used as a last resort.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>KDE üze bik çıdamlı bulsa da, anın astında eşlätelgän yazılımnarnıñ öşep toruı bar. Andí närsä öçralğan bulsa, <b>Ctrl+Alt+Esc</b> basqannan soñ çıqqan uq belän berär täräzägä çirtep, anı üterep bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>KMail is KDE's email client, but did you know that you can\n"
#~ "integrate it -- along with other programs -- to bring them all under\n"
#~ "one roof? Kontact was made to be a Personal Information Management\n"
#~ "suite, and it integrates all components under it seamlessly.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>Other possible programs to integrate with Kontact include\n"
#~ "KAddressBook (for handling Contacts), KNotes (for keeping notes),\n"
#~ "KNode (to keep up-to-date with the latest news), and KOrganizer (for a\n"
#~ "comprehensive calender).</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>KDE'neñ KMail atlı email kliente başqa yazılımnarğa da totaştırırğa bula. ü.ö. elemtälärne başqa yazılımnar belän büleşep bergä qullanıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>You can use the mouse wheel to quickly perform a number of tasks;\n"
#~ "here are a few you might not have known of: \n"
#~ "<ul><li>Ctrl+Mouse-Wheel in the Konqueror web browser to change the font-size,\n"
#~ "or in Konqueror file manager to change icon size.</li>\n"
#~ "<li>Shift+Mouse-Wheel for fast scrolling in all KDE applications.</li>\n"
#~ "<li>Mouse-Wheel over the taskbar in Kicker to quickly alternate between\n"
#~ "different windows.</li>\n"
#~ "<li>Mouse-Wheel over the Desktop Previewer and Pager to change\n"
#~ "desktop.</li></ul></p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Küse tägärmäçen qullanıp, törle närsä eşläp bula: \n"
#~ "<ul><li>Ctrl+Tägärmäç aşa Konqueror eçen yazu ülçämen üzgärtep bula.</li>\n"
#~ "<li>Shift+Tägärmäç aşa KDE-yazılımnarda tiz çornap bula.</li>\n"
#~ "</ul></p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>By pressing F4 in Konqueror you can open a terminal at your current\n"
#~ "location.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Konqueror eçendä F4 basıp, biredäge urınlaşuda terminal açıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Although KDE will automatically restore your KDE programs that were\n"
#~ "left open after you logged out, you can specifically tell KDE to start\n"
#~ "particular applications on start up; see the <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"Autostart\n"
#~ "FAQ\">FAQ entry</a> for more information.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>KDE yöklängändä ul siña KDE-yazılımnarnı da beryulı cibärep birä ala; bonı turında <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/faq/configure.html#id2574142\" title=\"AutostartFAQ\">YBS</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>You can integrate Kontact, KDE's Personal Information Management\n"
#~ "suit, with Kopete, KDE's Instant Messenger client, so that you can\n"
#~ "view contacts' online status, as well as respond to them easily from\n"
#~ "KMail itself. For a step-by-step guide, check <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
#~ "title=\"Integrated Messaging\">the KDE User Guide</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>KDE'neñ Şäxeslär Turında Belemne başqa yazılımnar belän büleşep qullanırğa bula; bonı turında <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/khelpcenter/userguide/integrated-messaging.html\"\n"
#~ "title=\"Integrated Messaging\">KDE Qullanması</a> eçendä uqıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>By entering <b>kmail --composer</b> in Konsole you can\n"
#~ "have KMail only open up the composer window, so that you do not have to\n"
#~ "open the entire email client when you only want to send an email to\n"
#~ "someone.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Konsol eçendä <b>kmail --composer</b> kertep, KMail yazılımınıñ xat cıyu täräzäsen acıp bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>While remembering passwords may be tedious, and writing them down\n"
#~ "on paper or in a text file may be insecure and untidy, KWallet is an\n"
#~ "application that can save and manage all of your passwords in strongly\n"
#~ "encrypted files, and permit access to them with the use of one master\n"
#~ "password.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>KWallet can be accessed from kcontrol, KDE's Control Center; from\n"
#~ "there, simply go to Security &amp; Privacy->KDE Wallet. For more\n"
#~ "information on KWallet and on how to use it, check <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/kwallet\" title=\"kwallet\">the handbook</a>.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "<p>Sersüzlärne istä totu ciñel närsä tügel. Bu eştä siña <a\n"
#~ "href=\"help:/kwallet\" title=\"kwallet\">KWallet</a> digän yazılım bulışa ala, ul sersüzläreñne üz eçendä serläp saqlí.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>By pressing the Middle Mouse-Button on the desktop you can get a\n"
#~ "brief list of all the windows on each desktop. From here you can also\n"
#~ " unclutter or cascade the windows.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Küseneñ üzäk töymäse belän östälne çirtep, ul östäldä urınlaşqan täräzä isemlegen kürep bula.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>Different virtual desktops can be customized individually, to a\n"
#~ "certain extent. For example, you can specify a particular background\n"
#~ "for a given desktop: Take a look in KDE's Control Center, under\n"
#~ "Appearance &amp; Themes->Background, or right-click on the desktop and\n"
#~ "select Configure Desktop.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Öställärneñ barısın da ayırım itep caylap bula, ü.ö. asyaq süräten bilgelärgä. Bonı öçen İdärä Üzäge eçendäge Küreneş bülegenä keräse.</p>\n"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "<p>While tabbed browsing in Konqueror is very useful, you can take\n"
#~ "this one step further if you choose to have a split view in order to\n"
#~ "view two locations at the same time. To access this feature, in\n"
#~ "Konqueror select Window->Split View, with either Top-Bottom or\n"
#~ "Left/Right, depending upon your choice.</p>\n"
#~ "<p>This setting will also only apply to a particular tab, rather than\n"
#~ "all tabs you have, so you can choose to have the split view for only\n"
#~ "some of the tabs where you might think it is useful.</p>\n"
#~ msgstr "<p>Konqueror eçendäge tabaqlı küreneş şaqtí uñay närsä, ü.ö. saylağında Täräzä->Küreneşne Bül digänen saylap, ber ük täräzä eçendä ike urınlaşunı kürep bula. Küreneşne buyğa da, arqılığa da bülep bula.</p>\n"
